{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_90_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_90","textTraditional":"一、二十有七年，春，〈木巳〉子來朝。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_90_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_90","textTraditional":"二、夏六月庚寅，齊侯昭卒。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_90_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_90","textTraditional":"三、秋八月乙未，葬齊孝公。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_90_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_90","textTraditional":"四、乙巳，公子遂帥師入〈木巳〉。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_90_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_90","textTraditional":"五、冬，楚人、陳侯、蔡侯、鄭伯、許男圍宋。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_90_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_90","textTraditional":"此楚子也，其稱人何？貶。曷為貶？為執宋公貶，故終僖之篇貶也。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_90_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_90","textTraditional":"六、十有二月甲戌，公會諸侯盟于宋。","sentenceOrder":7}],"overrides":{}}